    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This reason indicates that ARKit does not have the necessary landscape data to support geo tracking at the user’s current location.",
      "ko": "When you reset scene reconstruction, ARKit removes any existing mesh anchors ([`ARMeshAnchor`](armeshanchor.md)) from the session.",
      "sourceHash": "65602de29f3d9fbd5b39630c3a916a0a9c3eb6db114d67d610b7010762959261",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "See [`checkAvailability(completionHandler:)`](argeotrackingconfiguration/checkavailability(completionhandler:).md) for more information.",
      "ko": "자세한 내용은 [`checkAvailability(completionHandler:)`](argeotrackingconfiguration/checkavailability(completionhandler:).md)를 참조하세요.",
      "sourceHash": "00e103767b25922422a5b05aebb6b71d1ce811eea2a79439d74462b460f66577",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "If [`checkAvailability(completionHandler:)`](argeotrackingconfiguration/checkavailability(completionhandler:).md) returns [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) and an app begins a geo-tracking session, ARKit provides this state reason when the user has moved to an unsupported area.",
      "ko": "If [`checkAvailability(completionHandler:)`](argeotrackingconfiguration/checkavailability(completionhandler:).md) returns [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) and an app begins a geo-tracking session, ARKit provides this state reason when the user has moved to an unsupported area.",
      "sourceHash": "d7d58f1cd0b4ceefd45fd862a1d2b70a6acdbcff09b71d166a1a852d26c827e6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
